@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantFontColor #1B2635
  ActorBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ActorBorderColor #475569
  BoxBackgroundColor #E8F1FF
  BoxBorderColor #94A3B8
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAF6EE
skinparam noteBorderColor #E0C998
title JVM 시작 — java -cp . Main 에서 main 실행까지
' flowcast source: flowcast 합성 예제 (sequence). Amazon Corretto 21.0.1에서 java -Xlog:startuptime,class+load,class+init,class+resolve=debug 실행 출력과 JDK 소스 sun.launcher.LauncherHelper (checkAndLoadMain, loadMainClass, validateMainClass), JVMS 21 5장 기준
participant "셸" as sh
box "네이티브"
  participant "java 런처" as launcher
  participant "HotSpot VM" as vm
end box
box "자바"
  participant "LauncherHelper" as helper
  participant "App 클래스 로더" as app
  participant "Main" as main
  participant "Helper" as dep
end box

sh -> launcher : 1. java -cp . Main
launcher -> vm : 2. VM 생성
vm -> vm : 3. 인터프리터 생성, java.lang 클래스 초기화,\n모듈 시스템 초기화
vm --> launcher : 4. Create VM 완료
note over sh, dep
로딩: 초기화하지 않고 적재만
end note
launcher -> helper : 5. checkAndLoadMain
helper -> app : 6. Class.forName("Main", false, scl)
app -> app : 7. 부모 위임 뒤 클래스 경로에서 찾아 적재\n(source: file:)
app --> helper : 8. Class<Main>
note over sh, dep
링킹: main 메서드를 찾는 리플렉션이 검증을 일으킴
end note
helper -> main : 9. validateMainClass\n(MainMethodFinder.findMainMethod)
main -> main : 10. 검증 (class verification)\n준비 (static 필드 = 기본값)
main --> helper : 11. main(String[]) 확인
helper --> launcher : 12. Main 클래스
note over sh, dep
초기화와 실행
end note
launcher -> main : 13. main 호출 (JNI)
main -> main : 14. 초기화: <clinit> 실행\n(static int counter = init())
main -> main : 15. main 본문 실행
note over sh, dep
지연 로딩: 처음 쓰는 순간 해석
end note
main -> app : 16. Helper 심볼 해석, 로딩 요청\n(Main.java:6)
app --> main : 17. Class<Helper>
main -> dep : 18. invokestatic Helper.hello()
dep -> dep : 19. 검증, 초기화\n뒤 hello 실행
dep --> main : 20.
main --> launcher : 21. main 반환
launcher --> sh : 22. 종료 코드 0
@enduml

@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ParticipantBorderColor #475569
  ParticipantFontColor #1B2635
  ActorBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ActorBorderColor #475569
  BoxBackgroundColor #E8F1FF
  BoxBorderColor #94A3B8
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAF6EE
skinparam noteBorderColor #E0C998
title JVM 시작 — 예외: 메인 클래스를 찾지 못함
' flowcast source: flowcast 합성 예제 (sequence). Amazon Corretto 21.0.1에서 java -Xlog:startuptime,class+load,class+init,class+resolve=debug 실행 출력과 JDK 소스 sun.launcher.LauncherHelper (checkAndLoadMain, loadMainClass, validateMainClass), JVMS 21 5장 기준
participant "셸" as sh
box "네이티브"
  participant "java 런처" as launcher
  participant "HotSpot VM" as vm
end box
box "자바"
  participant "LauncherHelper" as helper
  participant "App 클래스 로더" as app
  participant "Main" as main
  participant "Helper" as dep
end box

sh -> launcher : 1. java -cp . Nope
launcher -> vm : 2. VM 생성
vm --> launcher : 3. Create VM 완료
launcher -> helper : 4. checkAndLoadMain
helper -> app : 5. Class.forName("Nope", false, scl)
app -> app : 6. 부모 위임 뒤 클래스 경로에도 없음
app --> helper : 7. ClassNotFoundException
helper --> sh : 8. abort: 오류 메시지 출력\n오류: 기본 클래스 Nope을(를) 찾거나 로드할 수 없습니다.\n원인: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: Nope
helper -> vm : 9. System.exit(1)
vm --> sh : 10. 종료 코드 1
@enduml
